  "_doc": "3-DC topology for prod-readiness campaign. dc-a anchors the corpus (DSL-class uplink); dc-b is warm+cache (mid-class) with 90-day TTL; dc-c is the fastest, warm-only. Storage A:B:C ratio ≈ 16:4:1 mapped onto pve01_ssd02 (hot+DC-C warm) and pve01_usb01..04 (DC-A cold + DC-B warm). PVE host is off-limits; only the 10.150.0.150-162 IP pool is in scope.",
